omances, and the fourth of five books released that year.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSusan lives in Washington state with her husband, two ragdoll cats, and a small poodle with delusions of grandeur. Her heart for animals has led Susan to become an active supporter of the Seattle Humane Society. Visit Susan online at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http://www.SusanMallery.com\"\u003ewww.SusanMallery.com\u003c/a\u003e.","isGrAuthor":true,"works":{"__typename":"ContributorWorksConnection","totalCount":875},"profileImageUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/authors/1435348452i/8716._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/8716.Susan_Mallery","viewerIsFollowing":null,"followers":{"__typename":"ContributorFollowersConnection","totalCount":15806},"user":{"__ref":"User:4098666"}},"Series:kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.eCUCU8cBX_UWGj789uUMJg":{"__typename":"Series","id":"kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.eCUCU8cBX_UWGj789uUMJg","title":"Royally Wed","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/series/60558-royally-wed"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.Msu4fbXJee2RikN5":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.Msu4fbXJee2RikN5","legacyId":231461692,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/231461692-summer-on-the-ranch","viewerShelving":null,"title":"Summer on the Ranch: A Modern Opposites Attract Cowboy Romance","titleComplete":"Summer on the Ranch: A Modern Opposites Attract Cowboy Romance (Royally Wed Book 1)","description":"Rediscover this opposites-attract cowboy romance by \u003cem\u003eNew York Times\u003c/em\u003e bestselling author Susan Mallery.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ePrincess Alexandra Wyndham’s mission to find her long-lost brother—the rightful heir to the throne—brings her to a ranch in Arizona, where she meets handsome cowboy Mitch Colton. Mitch could be the key to finding Alexandra’s missing brother, and although he is reluctant to open his home t